                                                "sense_id": "c8ac8625-f7b4-30d7-a45c-150296e22518",
                                                "text": "The Pirahã language challenges simplistic application of Hockett's nearly universally accepted design features of human language by showing that some of these features (interchangeability, displacement, and productivity) may be culturally constrained."
